---
title: Recognition Service Startup
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as FastAPI Application
    participant Settings as Pydantic Settings
    participant Factory as shared/startup/adapter_factory.py
    participant Roster as RosterStorageAdapter
    participant Hybrid as HybridIndexManager
    participant RecSvc as FaceRecognitionService

    App->>Settings: load()
    App->>Factory: build_roster_storage(DATABASE_URL)
    Factory-->>App: Roster adapter (PostgreSQL or SQLite)
    App->>Hybrid: HybridIndexManager(roster_adapter)
    App->>RecSvc: FaceRecognitionService(embedding_router(Hybrid))
    App->>App: stash singletons in dependencies
    App-->>App: set initialization_complete = True
